#. Translators: The name of the NVDA Speech Rewind add-on.
#. Add-on summary/title, usually the user visible name of the add-on
#. Translators: Summary/title for this add-on
#. to be shown on installation and add-on information found in add-on store
#: addon\globalPlugins\nvdaSpeechRewind.py:46 buildVars.py:29
msgid "Speech Rewind"
msgstr "语音回溯"

#. Translators: Message reported after speech history is cleared.
#: addon\globalPlugins\nvdaSpeechRewind.py:120
msgid "Speech history cleared"
msgstr "已清除语音历史记录"

#. Translators: Checkbox to enable recording speech history.
#: addon\globalPlugins\nvdaSpeechRewind.py:185
msgid "Enable speech history"
msgstr "启用语音历史记录"

#. Translators: Label for the maximum number of speech history items.
#: addon\globalPlugins\nvdaSpeechRewind.py:194
msgid "Maximum number of speech history items:"
msgstr "语音历史记录项目上限："

#. Translators: Button to clear all speech history items.
#: addon\globalPlugins\nvdaSpeechRewind.py:205
msgid "Clear speech history"
msgstr "清除语音历史记录"

#. Translators: Description for the command that repeats the current speech history item.
#: addon\globalPlugins\nvdaSpeechRewind.py:274
msgid ""
"Reports the last spoken information, or the current item when reviewing "
"speech history. Pressing twice shows the whole speech history in a browsable "
"message."
msgstr "读出最后朗读的内容，或查看语音历史记录时读出当前项目。连按两次，在浏览模式下显示完整的语音历史记录。"

#. Translators: Description for the command to review the previous speech history item.
#: addon\globalPlugins\nvdaSpeechRewind.py:305
msgid "Review the previous item in speech history"
msgstr "查看语音历史记录中的上一项"

#. Translators: Message reported when there is no older speech history item.
#: addon\globalPlugins\nvdaSpeechRewind.py:313
msgid "No previous item"
msgstr "没有上一项"

#. Translators: Description for the command to review the next speech history item.
#: addon\globalPlugins\nvdaSpeechRewind.py:319
msgid "Review the next item in speech history"
msgstr "查看语音历史记录中的下一项"

#. Translators: Message reported when there is no newer speech history item.
#: addon\globalPlugins\nvdaSpeechRewind.py:327
msgid "No next item"
msgstr "没有下一项"

#: addon\globalPlugins\nvdaSpeechRewind.py:334
msgid ""
"Copy the last spoken information to the clipboard, or the current item when "
"reviewing speech history."
msgstr "将最后朗读的内容复制到剪贴板，或查看语音历史记录时复制当前项目。"

#. Translators: Message reported when there is no speech history item to copy.
#: addon\globalPlugins\nvdaSpeechRewind.py:344
msgid "Nothing to copy"
msgstr "没有可复制的内容"

#. Translators: Message reported when there is no speech history item to review by character.
#: addon\globalPlugins\nvdaSpeechRewind.py:357
msgid "No speech history item"
msgstr "没有语音历史记录项目"

#. Translators: Input help mode message for moving to the previous character in speech history.
#: addon\globalPlugins\nvdaSpeechRewind.py:379
msgid "Moves to the previous character in speech history and speaks it"
msgstr "移到语音历史记录中的上一个字符并读出"

#. Translators: Message reported when reviewing at the left edge of text.
#: addon\globalPlugins\nvdaSpeechRewind.py:385
msgid "Left"
msgstr "左"

#. Translators: Input help mode message for reporting the current character in speech history.
#: addon\globalPlugins\nvdaSpeechRewind.py:390
msgid ""
"Reports the current character in speech history. Pressing twice reports a "
"description or example of that character. Pressing three times reports the "
"numeric value of the character in decimal and hexadecimal"
msgstr "读出语音历史记录中的当前字符，连按两次解释该字符，连按三次则读出该字符的十进制和十六进制代码"

#. Translators: Input help mode message for moving to the next character in speech history.
#: addon\globalPlugins\nvdaSpeechRewind.py:417
msgid "Moves to the next character in speech history and speaks it"
msgstr "移到语音历史记录中的下一个字符并读出"

#. Translators: Message reported when reviewing at the right edge of text.
#: addon\globalPlugins\nvdaSpeechRewind.py:423
msgid "Right"
msgstr "右"

#: buildVars.py:33
msgid ""
"Speech Rewind keeps a history of NVDA speech that can be reviewed, replayed, "
"and copied."
msgstr "语音回溯保存 NVDA 的语音历史记录，供查看、重复朗读和复制。"

#. Brief changelog for this version
#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
#: buildVars.py:39
msgid "Initial prototype release of NVDA Speech Rewind."
msgstr "NVDA 语音回溯初始原型版本。"
